<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Woolworths finance manager resigns.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Woolworths finance manager resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian retailer Woolworths Ltd said on Friday that Van Gold, the company's general manager of finance, has resigned effective September 27.</p>
<p>&quot;Mr Gold has indicated he wishes to pursue alternative career interests,&quot; Woolworths said in a statement to the Australian Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company said the appointment of a chief financial officer would be be announced in due course. &quot;This position will have additional responsibilities to the present role,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
